"You might want to use EXECUTE ... INTO or EXECUTE CREATE TABLE ... AS "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Альтернативой может стать EXECUTE ... INTO или EXECUTE CREATE TABLE ... "
"AS ..."

#. +> 19 18 17 16 15 14
#: pl_exec.c:4631
#, c-format
